### =========================================
### Day 6 - Support Desk API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### =========================================
### 1. Health Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

###

### =========================================
### 2. About Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/about

###

### =========================================
### 3. Get All Tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

###

### =========================================
### 4. Get Existing Ticket
# Replace 1 with an actual ticket ID if different
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1

###

### =========================================
### 5. Get Missing Ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/9999

###

### =========================================
### 6. Create Valid Ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cannot login",
  "description": "Unable to login after password reset",
  "category": "Authentication",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "createdBy": "Lio"
}

